OL,3,ATwo dead after bus crashes in France,
OL,4,Aofficials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young girl and an 18-year-old man
OL,7,Fhave died after a bus crashed in
OL,8,Feastern France, local authorities have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe bus was travelling between Lyon and
OL,12,FBourg-en-Bresse when it crashed at
OL,13,Faround 07:00 local time on Friday in
OL,14,Fthe town of Lent, around 34 miles
OL,15,F(55km) from the border with
OL,16,FSwitzerland.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
